        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes... you're a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not just any stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell off your tree and now you're on a journey — not just to return to your trunk, but to prove that even a lifeless piece of wood can <strong>do the impossible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce, roll and rage your way across floating furniture, garden tools, weird junk, and even industrial machinery in a physically absurd world that’s constantly trying to throw you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that hate you (but you love anyway), <strong>I Am A Stick</strong> is a brutally challenging platformer where every movement counts, and every fall hurts — emotionally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a stick find its way home? You’ll laugh, you’ll scream, and maybe, just maybe... you’ll find meaning in the splinters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes... you're a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not just any stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell off your tree and now you're on a journey — not just to return to your trunk, but to prove that even a lifeless piece of wood can <strong>do the impossible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce, roll and rage your way across floating furniture, garden tools, weird junk, and even industrial machinery in a physically absurd world that’s constantly trying to throw you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that hate you (but you love anyway), <strong>I Am A Stick</strong> is a brutally challenging platformer where every movement counts, and every fall hurts — emotionally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a stick find its way home? You’ll laugh, you’ll scream, and maybe, just maybe... you’ll find meaning in the splinters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Advance, fall, suffer, repeat. You're a stick with something to prove.",
